  ('wandering-trader-sells-saplings', 'en', 'Which of these can you buy from a wandering trader?', 'Netherite Ingots', 'Elytra', 'Saplings', 'Diamonds', 'Wandering traders mostly sell nature items like saplings, flowers, seeds and dyes.'),
