  ('lure-makes-fish-bite-sooner', 'en', 'Which fishing rod enchantment makes fish bite sooner?', 'Luck of the Sea', 'Mending', 'Lure', 'Unbreaking', 'Lure shortens the wait before something bites your hook.'),
