  ('blast-protection-vs-explosions', 'en', 'Which armor enchantment is made to reduce explosion damage?', 'Projectile Protection', 'Feather Falling', 'Blast Protection', 'Fire Protection', 'Blast Protection lowers the damage you take from creepers and other explosions.'),
