  ('mending-never-from-table', 'en', 'Which enchantment can never come from an enchanting table?', 'Mending', 'Efficiency', 'Protection', 'Unbreaking', 'Mending is a treasure enchantment, so you find it in loot, fishing or trades instead.'),
