  ('hero-effect-lasts-40-minutes', 'en', 'How long does the Hero of the Village effect last?', '10 minutes', '1 hour', '40 minutes', '20 minutes', 'Hero of the Village lasts 40 minutes, so trade a lot after a raid.'),
